Raine (Ambiguously Sexed Sword Master)
======================================

*"I will atone for the sins of my past by helping those who cannot help themselves!"*

*A wandering swordsman seeking atonement for his years as an assassin.*

**Background**

Once a skilled assassin for the Clan Cave Fox, Raine broke from
the clan after discovering that a contract kill was, in fact, his
own estranged father. Disgusted with himself, he abandoned that
life -- but the clan doesn't let members leave, and dispatched
his old comrade Shou to hunt him down. Raine now wanders, trying
to atone by helping those he can.

**Personality**

Reserved and thoughtful, Raine speaks only when he has something
worth saying, and his mind often wanders even when he's paying
close attention -- a habit that leads people to underestimate
him. He practices swordsmanship and origami in his spare time,
often folding paper to help himself think.

